1
00:00:03,052 --> 00:00:05,411
Mila breathes on the mirror: fog!

2
00:00:05,461 --> 00:00:07,381
Noah takes a big breath in.

3
00:00:07,431 --> 00:00:09,840
But actually, what do we breathe?

4
00:00:10,632 --> 00:00:12,549
Noah catches air in a bag.

5
00:00:12,599 --> 00:00:15,879
You can't see anything, but the bag is full!

6
00:00:15,929 --> 00:00:18,073
Mila presses: it pushes back.

7
00:00:18,123 --> 00:00:18,955
Air exists!

8
00:00:19,732 --> 00:00:21,246
Discovery mission!

9
00:00:23,762 --> 00:00:24,321
Mini mode!

10
00:00:24,371 --> 00:00:25,663
Air is a mix of gases.

11
00:00:25,713 --> 00:00:29,261
Out of one hundred balls of air: seventy-eight of nitrogen,

12
00:00:29,311 --> 00:00:32,422
twenty-one of oxygen, and a handful of other gases.

13
00:00:33,222 --> 00:00:36,511
You breathe in: the air goes down into your lungs,

14
00:00:36,561 --> 00:00:37,513
into tiny sacs.

15
00:00:37,563 --> 00:00:39,784
The oxygen passes into your blood,

16
00:00:39,834 --> 00:00:42,639
which brings back a waste: carbon dioxide.

17
00:00:43,410 --> 00:00:46,021
You breathe out: a little less oxygen,

18
00:00:46,071 --> 00:00:48,052
a little more carbon dioxide…

19
00:00:48,102 --> 00:00:49,172
and water vapor.

20
00:00:49,222 --> 00:00:51,393
That's what fogs up the mirror!

21
00:00:52,171 --> 00:00:56,084
Your body burns food with oxygen to make energy.

22
00:00:56,134 --> 00:00:58,148
And who makes the oxygen?

23
00:00:58,198 --> 00:00:58,726
Plants!

24
00:00:58,776 --> 00:01:00,179
Thank you, trees.

25
00:01:00,954 --> 00:01:02,536
That's what we breathe.

26
00:01:04,509 --> 00:01:05,721
Air is a mix of gases;

27
00:01:05,771 --> 00:01:09,501
your body keeps the oxygen and lets out carbon dioxide and water.

28
00:01:10,450 --> 00:01:13,329
With an adult: breathe on a cold mirror.

29
00:01:13,379 --> 00:01:16,112
The fog is the water from your breath.

30
00:01:16,162 --> 00:01:17,919
Count how long it stays!

31
00:01:18,681 --> 00:01:21,419
And why do leaves change color in autumn?

32
00:01:21,469 --> 00:01:22,829
The answer tomorrow.
